Description: Wild OS base system
 Identity and security layer of Wild OS. Pulls in the Kicksecure hardening
 packages (kernel and sysctl hardening, AppArmor profiles, secure time sync,
 USB device control, RAM wipe on shutdown) and marks the system as Wild OS.
